{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Peter Visits Vanessa at Work", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Grabbing Dinner ", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 1, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 7, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Use expressions about relationships and feelings in a range of social and work contexts. ", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies important and specific information and aspects of attitude and intention in conversations, texts or presentations about common technology. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Talking about Wishes and Imaginary Situations  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "You use <span class =\"italic\">\u201cI wish ... \u201d</span> to talk about things you do not have or do, or you cannot have or do.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "The verb <span class =\"italic\">wish</span> introduces an idea. It is something that is not true, but you would like to be true.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "After <span class =\"italic\">wish</span>, you use a verb in the past tense.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class =\"italic\">I wish I knew ... <br/>I wish I had ... <br/>I wish you were ... </span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Structure: <br/> Wish + past tense", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Meaning</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish it was a weekday.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want it to be a weekday, but it is a weekend.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish I knew more about design. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want to know about design, but I don't.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish we were going to Ned's.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I want to go to Ned's, but I'm not going there.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class =\\\"italic\\\">I wish we served lobster!</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I would like us to serve lobster, but we don't.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Phrasal Verbs with \u201cGo\u201d  ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "A phrasal verb is a phrase made from a verb + preposition.  <br/><br/>The combination of the verb and preposition changes the meaning of the verb.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Many phrasal verbs start with the verb <span class =\"italic\">\u201cgo\u201d</span>:", "type": "text"}, {"content": "to go out -- to leave the house<br/>to go by -- to pass an amount of time<br/>to go with -- to match, to be well suited<br/>to go over -- to study, to read carefully<br/>to go along -- to accept, agree<br/>to go off -- to ring or sound out, like a bell or whistle", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You conjugate phrasal verbs in the same way you conjugate other verbs.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Affirmative Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Question Form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Tense</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I go out on Saturdays.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Do you go out on Saturdays?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I am going out this evening.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Are you going out this evening?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Continuous tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I went out last Saturday.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Did you go out last Saturday?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Simple Past tense\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"I have gone out every Saturday this month.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Have you gone out every Saturday this month?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Present Perfect tense\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "I can't believe six months have gone by!", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The designer went over her plans.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "The mural on the wall goes with the design.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "design", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way an object or environment appears, after careful thought and planning", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I wish I knew more about design. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob01aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use to talk about social activities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to grab dinner", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to have an informal dinner with someone, usually a friend ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm glad we decided to grab dinner at your restaurant.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob01aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "mural", "type": "name"}, {"content": "very large image (painting, photograph, etc.), usually painted on a wall or in a public space", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  The mural on the wall goes well with the design.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob01aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "lighting", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the  source, quality, and amount of light in an area", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  I love the design. The lighting is perfect.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob01aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "live music", "type": "name"}, {"content": "people playing musical instruments and singing before an audience", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example:  We're going to listen to some live music. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob01aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "band", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a group of musicians playing together, usually including people playing instruments or singing", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We're going to listen to some live music. A new band is playing.  ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob01aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"content": "engenn7le07ob01re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Prepare 10 small cards with true and imaginary statements about your life. Use the Present tense. For example, you can write:  <span class=\"italic\">I speak English. I go to Florida every year. I live in New York.</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner to prepare 10 more cards.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Mix up the 20 cards and place them face down.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Pick one of the cards. Make a sentence with the information on the card. Start with: <span class=\"italic\">It's true that...</span> if it is true or <span class=\"italic\">I wish...</span> if it is not true.  Explain why you made that sentence.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner picks a card and does the same thing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Continue the game until there are no more cards. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write true and imaginary statements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to true and imaginary statements.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I explain my opinion.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le07ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob01re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Nice place, Vanessa! I'm glad we decided to grab dinner at your restaurant. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  Thanks!  I can't believe six months have gone by and it's the first time you've been to Bistro 88! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: It's so busy today! <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I know. I wish it was a weekday.  We would have more time to chat. Could you do me a favor? Tell me what you think about the design. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Everything looks very well organized. The mural on the wall goes with the colors, and the lighting is perfect."}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob01re2img01.jpg", "time": "30500", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  I like it too. I wish I knew more about design.  The designer went over her plans, but I didn't understand them at the time.  I went along with her decision.  Now I think it looks great. What are you doing later today? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I'm going out with a couple of friends. We're having a meal at Angelo's. I wish we were going to Ned's. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  What's going on at Angelo's?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: We're going to listen to some live music. A new band is playing."}, {"image": "engenn7le07ob01re2img02.jpg", "time": "57000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: What's that sound? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:  That's a bell for the waiters.  When the bell goes off, it means one shift is over and the next one is beginning. What do you want to order? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think I'll have lobster. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I wish we served lobster!"}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le07ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le07ob01re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "I can talk about social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about wishes and imaginary situations.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can ask someone a favor. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "What's your favorite day? Why?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": "What would you do if it was that day?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "I wish it was Friday!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Vanessa and Peter are <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">grabbing</span> a meal at Bistro 88!", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}, {"content": "Listening", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"content": [{"content": "Usually, to <span class =\"italic\">\"grab\"</span> means to take something quickly. To <span class =\"italic\">grab a meal</span> means to eat a meal quickly or informally.", "tip_id": 0, "type": "text"}], "type": "tips"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on the play button to listen to the audio.", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "type": "question"}], "id": 0, "responses": [{"correct": 0, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "selected": 0, "_data": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}], "id": 1}]}], "type": "STI", "id": 1, "stimuli_ids": [1]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " Peter and Vanessa talk about some of their social activities.", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Activity 1", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": "", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "You are done!", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"contents": [{"content": 6, "type": "pairs"}, {"content": 9, "type": "height"}, {"content": 16, "type": "width"}], "type": "options"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Reading", "type": "skill"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Instructions: Click on a card to flip it over. Find the matching definition. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "questions": [{"_data"